<header class="ref-head cty-head"><p class="cty-kicker">Country history · Oceania</p><h1 class="research-title">History of the Cook Islands</h1><p class="ref-lede">3 recorded states lay in what is now the Cook Islands, from the Kingdom of Rarotonga (1858 CE) to the Cook Islands. 2 outside powers ruled here.</p></header>
